<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM Litho shares surge on Intel results.</title>
<headline>ASM Litho shares surge on Intel results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch semiconductor equipment maker ASM Lithography NV jumped six guilders, or more than six percent, to 105.00 guilders on Wednesday in the wake of Tuesday's strong earnings from U.S. Intel Corp.</p>
<p>Intel led a rally in technology stocks on Wall Street on Tuesday after reporting a more than doubling of fourth quarter earnings. High technology stocks were expected to surge higher again on Wednesday when trading resumed in New York.</p>
<p>Philips Electronics holds a 35 percent stake in ASM Lithography.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
